b&gt;&lt;br&gt;CloudFront · WAF · Elastic Load Balancing (ALB) · VPC (NAT, S3 endpoint) · ECS on Fargate · ECR · Lambda · Aurora PostgreSQL Serverless v2 · S3 · GuardDuty Malware Protection · EventBridge + Scheduler · SQS · SNS · SES · Cognito · Secrets Manager · KMS · IAM (OIDC) · CloudWatch · Reachability Analyzer (e2e) · Terraform state on S3 + KMS" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#F8F9FA;strokeColor=#D5DBDB;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=10;fontColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="120" width="175" height="230" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c63" value="&lt;b&gt;Rules shown&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• customer routes only on :8080 (user token)&lt;br&gt;• service routes only on :8081 (service token + scope)&lt;br&gt;• other users' data → 404&lt;br&gt;• evidence bytes never touch services&lt;br&gt;• email only to dispute owner (lookup by user_id)&lt;br&gt;• DB is source of truth; events after commit" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#F8F9FA;strokeColor=#D5DBDB;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=10;fontColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="720" width="175" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
